{{ 'component-slider.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'section-recently-viewed.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'recently-viewed.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<script src="{{ 'card-photo-preview.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{%- comment -%}
  "You Recently Viewed", after moonmagic's own row of that name (2026-10-01, at the
  owner's request: "add like moonmagic section You Recently Viewed above Отзиви от
  клиенти"). Theirs sits directly above their Customer Reviews: a heading, then a row
  of square pictures each with the stone and the name under it -- no price -- the
  product you are on left out, arrows at the top right that appear only when the row
  overflows. It keeps what you looked at in the visitor's own browser and draws the
  row from that, with nothing fetched, and shows nothing at all until there is
  something to show.

  Ours does the same, in assets/recently-viewed.js. This section puts the current
  product's handle, title, address and picture on the element; the script adds it to
  a short list in localStorage (the most recent twelve), then draws every product on
  the list except the current one. Written once here and read by the script, so it
  works on any template that carries the section: on a page with no product it
  records nothing and only shows the list.

  The element starts `hidden` and the script reveals it, padding and all, only when
  there is at least one other product -- so a first-time visitor sees the page exactly
  as before, and without JavaScript nothing changes either. moonmagic's does the same:
  on the first product a visitor opens, their row is empty and takes no room.

  In the theme editor alone it shows even with nothing to show -- empty picture slots
  and a line saying when visitors see it -- so the section can be seen and selected
  there (2026-10-01: the owner, looking for it, found nothing). `request.design_mode`
  is only true inside the editor, so no visitor and no preview link ever sees this.

  Cards are a picture and a title, like theirs, not this theme's full product card:
  that one carries swatches, a price and hover behaviour that cannot be rebuilt from
  four stored strings, and moonmagic does not show them here either.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- style -%}
  .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

{%- comment -%}
  2026-10-06 (owner): a second photo for the temporary preview (hover / touch and hold,
  assets/card-photo-preview.js), chosen like the product cards' -- the first image tied
  to no variant, so never another metal. None: the card has no preview.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign rv_second = null
  if product and product.media.size > 1 and product.featured_media
    assign rv_variant_ids = ','
    for v in product.variants
      if v.featured_media
        assign rv_variant_ids = rv_variant_ids | append: v.featured_media.id | append: ','
      endif
    endfor
    for m in product.media
      if m.media_type != 'image' or m.id == product.featured_media.id
        continue
      endif
      assign rv_key = ',' | append: m.id | append: ','
      if rv_variant_ids contains rv_key
        continue
      endif
      assign rv_second = m
      break
    endfor
  endif
-%}
<recently-viewed
  class="recently-viewed color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }} gradient"
  data-max="{{ section.settings.max_products }}"
  {%- if request.design_mode %}
    data-design-mode
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if product %}
    data-handle="{{ product.handle | escape }}"
    data-title="{{ product.title | escape }}"
    data-url="{{ product.url }}"
    {%- if product.featured_media %}
      data-image="{{ product.featured_media.preview_image | image_url }}"
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if rv_second %}
      data-image2="{{ rv_second.preview_image | image_url }}"
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif %}
  hidden
>
  <div class="recently-viewed__inner page-width section-{{ section.id }}-padding">
    <div class="recently-viewed__header">
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <h2 class="recently-viewed__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}
      <div class="recently-viewed__buttons" hidden>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="slider-button slider-button--prev"
          name="previous"
          aria-label="{{ 'general.slider.previous_slide' | t }}"
        >
          <span class="svg-wrapper">
            {{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
          </span>
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="slider-button slider-button--next"
          name="next"
          aria-label="{{ 'general.slider.next_slide' | t }}"
        >
          <span class="svg-wrapper">
            {{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
          </span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- if request.design_mode -%}
      <p class="recently-viewed__note" hidden>
        Само в редактора: тук посетителят вижда продуктите, които е разгледал преди този.
        Секцията се показва, след като е отворил поне още един продукт.
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}
    <ul class="recently-viewed__track" role="list"></ul>
  </div>
</recently-viewed>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Recently viewed",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Shows the products this visitor opened before the one they are on. It stays hidden, and takes no room, until they have opened another product, so it is empty in the editor until you browse the preview first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "default": "Наскоро разгледани",
      "label": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "max_products",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 12,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 8,
      "label": "Most products to show"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1",
      "label": "Colour scheme"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding top",
      "default": 72
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding bottom",
      "default": 40
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Recently viewed"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
